{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的感受词有些堆叠和同义反复，个别抽象或混杂的比喻会抢走人物心理主线的注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用加亮短语突出每段叙事的关键，感受文字又按音乐进程出现，观众不必读完所有内容也能抓住情绪变化，纵向交替的阅读顺序也比较自然。两版对人物动机的解释都足够清楚，但 Y 对音乐起伏、身体感受和复杂情绪的细分更丰富，尤其能表现欢喜、依恋、惶恐和不舍同时存在的状态。它的主要问题是部分感受表达过密，偶尔显得刻意堆砌，但不足以抵消整体优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b613d8f7-235b-4473-970b-1852c0d416a7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054146717709Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:43:08.485231+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ae06e4dcd63e52cfb2ff938d8ee96e1a8b0baaa0b53214b296497ff68e4680a7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23